       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RDOFFSETWRITE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 P PIC X(8) VALUE '12345678'.
       01 OFFS PIC 9.
       01 SEL PIC 9.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       ACCEPT SEL.
       IF SEL = 1 MOVE 1 TO OFFS ELSE MOVE 5 TO OFFS END-IF.
       MOVE 'ABCD' TO P(OFFS:4).
       CALL P.
       GOBACK.
